      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "לקקו\/ילקו",
      "rationale": "Wanpela rot i kamap tupela taim — ol dok i laikim blut bilong Navot, olsem na ol bai laikim blut bilong Ahap; pasin i no lus long Tok Pisin."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "גם אתה",
      "rationale": "Ol tanim tok i no wankain: 'yu yet' (KJV) o 'tu ol dok bai kaikai bodi bilong yu' (samting we i no stap long ves ia, i stap long ves 24)."
